@startuml BloodCountSimplified

actor User
participant LoginWindow
participant MainWindow
participant IDECWorker
participant VaDEWorker
participant "Data Files"
participant "AI Models"

== Authentication ==
User -> LoginWindow: login
LoginWindow -> MainWindow: create main window
destroy LoginWindow

== IDEC Analysis ==
User -> MainWindow: select CSV 
User -> MainWindow: atart analysis 
MainWindow -> IDECWorker: run IDEC pipeline
activate IDECWorker

IDECWorker -> "Data Files": load CSV data
IDECWorker -> "AI Models": load IDEC & AutoEncoder
IDECWorker -> IDECWorker: perform clustering
IDECWorker -> MainWindow: return results (RBC/PLT counts + plot)
deactivate IDECWorker

MainWindow -> User: display IDEC results

== VaDE Analysis ==
User -> MainWindow: start VaDE clustering
MainWindow -> VaDEWorker: run VaDE pipeline
activate VaDEWorker

VaDEWorker -> "Data Files": load RBC classified data
VaDEWorker -> "AI Models": load VaDE model
VaDEWorker -> VaDEWorker: perform RBC subtype clustering
VaDEWorker -> MainWindow: return (single RBC/oincidence/reticulocyte + plot)
deactivate VaDEWorker

MainWindow -> User: display VaDE results

== Application Close ==
User -> MainWindow: close application
MainWindow -> MainWindow: cleanup & shutdown

@enduml